---
import { communityFeatures } from '../../data/features';
---

<section class="section-shell">
  <div class="max-w-3xl">
    <h2 class="section-title">大概就是這些東西混在一起</h2>
    <p class="section-copy">
      頻道不用被塞滿才算活著。有人丟東西時就聊一下，沒人說話時也不用硬撐場面。
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-10 grid gap-x-10 gap-y-0 md:grid-cols-2">
    {
      communityFeatures.map((feature) => (
        <article class="border-t border-[var(--color-border)] py-5">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">
            {feature.title}
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
            {feature.description}
          </p>
        </article>
      ))
    }
  </div>
</section>
